  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith (SI-309/50, 100, 101, 102, 103, 104, 105, 106 received 08.08.11, SI-309/104 received 26.09.1, SI-309/107 received 27.09.11.) and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - No development shall take place until details have be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority for a scheme of acoustic insulation and any associated ventilation to ensure the maximum noise level to be permitted within dwellings with windows shut and any other necessary means of ventilation provided shall not exceed the \"reasonable\" limits contained in BS8233:1999. These being LAeq, 16hour = 40 dB in living rooms, and a night (07:00 - 23:00) LAeq, 8hour = 35 dB and LAFmax = 45 dB in bedrooms, and a night LAeq, 1hour = 45 dB in Kitchens, Bathrooms and Utility Rooms \". The details shall be carried out as approved.",
    "Condition : 5 - Before the development is commenced, details of a sound insulation scheme to separate the residential accommodation hereby approved and the adjoining commercial premises shall be submitted to the local authority and approved in writing. Development shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details prior to the first use of the development.",
    "Condition : 6 - \"Before the development hereby permitted commences the applicant must either:\r\na.\tInvestigate the site for landfill gas to the satisfaction of the LPA, to ascertain whether gas protection measures are required.  Where measures are required the details shall be submitted to, and approved by, the LPA.\r\nOr;\r\nb.\tThe applicant shall install gas protection measures as a precautionary measure without first investigating the site.  The details of these measures shall be submitted to, and approved by, the LPA.\r\nc.\tFor a. and b. all required measures shall be installed before the development is first occupied.\r\n"
  ],
